# What is committed under manuscript/: the reproduction's code and the small
# inputs it cannot regenerate -- README.md, notebooks/, analysis/, configs/,
# data/genesets/gobp_category_map.tsv and data/raw/MANIFEST.sha256.
# Everything the notebooks write is regenerated from those, so none of it is
# committed.

# Inputs (~134 MB), obtained by notebooks/00_inputs.ipynb and checked against
# MANIFEST.sha256, which is the one file here that is committed.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/MANIFEST.sha256

# MSigDB gene sets require licence acceptance and cannot be redistributed.
# Notebook 00 writes them here. The GO-slim theme map beside them is derived
# from the Gene Ontology and is committed.
data/genesets/*.gmt

# Generated by the notebooks: the built matrix and annotation (01), pathway
# scores, pipeline output and gathered tables (02-04), the MYCN sample lists
# and runs (02), and the figures, tables and data of the paper (03-05).
data/processed/
results/
nbl_mycn/
submission/

# The authors' checking tools and the analyses the paper does not report; not
# part of the release. Remove these two lines to version them.
dev/
exploratory/

# Tooling
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.ruff_cache/
